    "shutdown_ritual_html": "<h1>End-of-day shutdown (~3 minutes)</h1>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Log</strong> \u2014 Record today's hours and time slots (done for you if you told Cursor).</li>\n<li><strong>Pick one</strong> \u2014 Write tomorrow's first task only (not the whole backlog).</li>\n<li><strong>Schedule</strong> \u2014 Block exact hours you'll work tomorrow, around meetings.</li>\n<li><strong>Close</strong> \u2014 Quit Cursor, close work tabs, step away from the desk.</li>\n<li><strong>Release</strong> \u2014 Say: <em>\"Work is parked until tomorrow.\"</em></li>\n</ol>\n<p>The handoff is the point \u2014 so your brain can stop rehearsing tickets overnight.</p>",
